# VC-ASC-20/21 baseline.
# rotated_ring: a 270 deg revolve (r 900..1060) rotated about X. True half-extent in Y/Z <= 1060.
#   measure_bounding_box today: 1240.438 -> conservative x1.17 (measured 2026-10-28; the engine inlet with its own cutaway rotation gave 1445.255, x1.366).
# pylon_loft: ruled loft through rectangles with a common flat underside at z = 960;
#   a box whose top is z = 960 overlaps it today (check_assembly FPR_PAIR_HARD, penetration 0.206 mm, overlap 6587 mm^3).
